// The one rename the `.tutu` migration performs, and the list of what it must
// not touch.
//
// It is its own package because two callers have to agree about it exactly:
// `tutufile/totutu` applies it when converting a file, and `tutufile/equiv`
// applies it when checking that the conversion preserved meaning. A converter
// and a checker with two spellings of the same rule would pass every file and
// prove nothing.
